      "text": "TIMELINE:\n  1905 — Fauvism (Matisse, Derain): Salon d'Automne\n  1907 — Proto-Cubism: Les Demoiselles d'Avignon (Picasso)\n  1908–12 — Analytic Cubism (Picasso, Braque)\n  1910 — First abstract watercolor (Kandinsky, disputed)\n  1913 — Armory Show (NY): Modern art arrives in America\n  1913 — Duchamp's first readymade (Bicycle Wheel)\n  1913 — Mondrian begins abstract development\n  1916 — Dada founded in Zurich (Cabaret Voltaire)\n  1917 — Fountain (Duchamp) — the readymade as art object\n  1920 — De Stijl movement (Mondrian, van Doesburg)\n  1936 — Abstract Expressionism beginning to form\n```"
